  "content": "Week 27: Guassian Splatting\n\nAI on Chrome\n\nYou can run AI model on Chrome DEV. Just follow this link.\n\nMemory Leaking\n\nBetter Stack has a good article about memory leaking in Node.js.\n\nGuassian Splatting\n\nBecause I caught cold this week, I did not do many things. I watched a lot videos about guassian splatting. To understand how it works.\n\n3D Gaussian Splatting! - Computerphile\n\n3D 重建技術 (三): 3D Gaussian Splatting，讓 3D 重建從學術走向實際應用的革新技術！用彩色橢圓球球表示場景！\n\nLoRA\n\nLoRA是什么？| 5分钟讲清楚LoRA的工作原理",
